<section class="w-full bg-neutral-950 py-24 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="mb-12 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
      Manifesto
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-left text-lg text-neutral-300 sm:text-xl">
      <p>
        Numen Games believes in the ability of humans to learn through play and in
        the power of games to enrich and improve the quality of human
        relationships, as well as their inherent necessity to organize in groups.
      </p>

      <p>
        We focus on the capacity of every individual to create change through
        curiosity and creativity, leveling up relationships within organizations.
        We are building a game to work better.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe the organizational legacy of the Second Industrial Revolution
        has reached its end. A new path must be opened for digital organizations
        where humans can truly thrive. While honoring what we have learned, we
        choose to build differently — putting people and fairer relationships at
        the center.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-2 text-center text-lg italic text-neutral-400 sm:text-xl">
      <p>Numen Games believes humans play to learn.</p>
      <p>Numen Games understands art as a driver.</p>
      <p>Numen Games supports remix culture.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
